  "worked_solution": "To integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each componentt separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{4}\u27e82t-1,\\,\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{t}}\u27e9\\text{d}t & =\u27e8{\\int }_{1}^{4}(2t-1)\\,\\text{d}t,{\\int }_{1}^{4}\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{t}}\\,\\text{d}t\u27e9 \\\\  & =\u27e8({t}^{2}-t)\\,\\,{|}_{1}^{4},\\,\\sqrt{t}\\,\\,{|}_{1}^{4}\\,\\,\u27e9 \\\\  & =\u27e8\\text{\u00a0}({4}^{2}-4)-({1}^{2}-1),\\,\\sqrt{4}-\\sqrt{1}\u27e9 \\\\  & =\u27e812,\\,1\u27e9\\end{aligned}\n$$",
